// Comment  : This file contains the first Qt Quick backend contract slice for the backend-neutral UI model. It intentionally stays managed and
//            testable: the class implements the hosting interfaces and currently falls back to the debug backend, while already exposing the
//            Qt-specific backend identity and initialization state expected by a future native bridge.
//
// Type     : ILC source code fixture
